Significant political differences between people between candidates on issues,

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:18.420
but at the same time we want to make sure that we don't fall into a trap of making

00:00:18.939 --> 00:00:25.949
relatively small differences into a bigger deal than they need to be at the possible risk of hurting our own movements.

00:00:25.949 --> 00:00:32.249
This was in the context of not just the 2020 election, but we talked about that and it turns out that it was extraordinarily

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:36.209
timely for me to talk about that at the beginning of the week.

